  "notes": "Datasheet has 16 boom lengths (10.9, 14.4, 17.9, 21.4, 24.9, 28.4, 31.9, 35.4, 38.9, 42.4, 45.9, 49.4, 52.9, 55.5, 58.0, 60.0 m); 12 stored. Omitted columns (t@radius m): 35.4 m: 21@6, 20.1@7, 18.7@8, 17.5@9, 16.2@10, 14@12, 12.2@14, 10@16, 8.9@18, 7.5@20, 6.4@22, 5.8@24, 5.1@26, 4.5@28, 3.9@30, 3.5@32; 42.4 m: 13.9@8, 13.7@9, 13@10, 11.7@12, 10.5@14, 9.4@16, 8.4@18, 7.1@20, 6.2@22, 5.5@24, 4.8@26, 4.1@28, 3.6@30, 3.2@32, 2.9@34, 2.6@36, 2.3@38, 2@40; 49.4 m: 9.7@10, 9.5@12, 8.8@14, 8.1@16, 7.3@18, 6.6@20, 5.8@22, 5.1@24, 4.5@26, 3.9@28, 3.4@30, 2.9@32, 2.5@34, 2.1@36, 1.8@38, 1.5@40, 1.3@42, 1.1@44, 0.9@46; 55.5 m: 6.9@12, 6.7@14, 6.6@16, 6.3@18, 5.9@20, 5.3@22, 4.5@24, 3.8@26, 3.2@28, 2.7@30, 2.2@32, 1.8@34, 1.5@36, 1.1@38, 0.9@40. 10,9* over-rear column (excluded): 80@2.5, 39.5@3, 39.5@3.5, 39.5@4, 39.5@4.5, 39.5@5, 36.2@6, 31.6@7, 25.8@8 (80.0 t at 2.5 m is max capacity over rear with additional special equipment only). The 2.5 m row is empty in all 360° columns and was dropped. Across a row, longer booms sometimes show higher values than shorter ones (as printed). Note 1) capacities with horizontal boom: 10.9 m 14.5, 14.4 m 10.7, 17.9 m 8.4, 21.4 m 6.8, 24.9 m 5.5, 28.4 m 4.5, 31.9 m 3.7, 35.4 m 2.9, 38.9 m 2.3, 42.4 m 1.9, 45.9 m 1.1, 49.4 m 0.7 t. Datasheet notes: ratings per EN13000; weight of hook blocks and slings is part of the load and must be deducted. Counterweight 17.7 t = 9.3 t basic (5 pcs) + 1 additional piece. Dimensions p.6 (mm): overall length incl. boom 12085, carrier length 10603, boom overhang ahead of carrier 1482; axle spacing 3198 (front to axle 1), 1650, 2440, 1650; rear overhang 1665 (+360); slewing centre 210 ahead of axle 3 (derived position 7078 from carrier front). Outrigger spans in top view: 5159 + 2885 = 8044 (one side) and 4921 + 3155 = 8076 (other side); chart heading says 8.08 m. Transverse 6480 max (2330/3180/4480 intermediate). Heights 3900 (3840 with standard 385/95R25 tyres) and 3629 (3569) shown - 3840 taken as overall transport height with standard tyres. Width 2550 (2750 with 525/80R25). Tail radius R4280 at counterweight (R3700, R3620 also shown). Operating weight, max outrigger force, max hook height, boom pivot and number of boom sections not given numerically."
